  "solution": "Ta tính được các góc trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> như sau\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>137</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>35</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tÁp dụng định lí sin cho tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>35</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tXét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>47</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" mathvariant=\"normal\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" mathvariant=\"normal\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Chiều cao tòa nhà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" mathvariant=\"normal\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" mathvariant=\"normal\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
